        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive on the Forsaken?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Forsaken, you are a clone on a broken ship. You must repair the ship and escape the nearby asteroid field. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things are not that easy, an alien robotic race wants the ship, and they will do anything to stop you escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine Asteroids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine the nearby asteroids for resources. Upgrade your mining ship to travel faster, increase how far you can go and get more valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be vigilant, the robotic aliens lurk in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras/4e8dd3c00d71e75c9fb61fe442029168.avif?t=1764333420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras_big/4e8dd3c00d71e75c9fb61fe442029168.avif?t=1764333420 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new weapons and craft items to repair the ship, there are many workstations to unlock so you better get leveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras/d9eb7d42a1bbaf1dd49b060fab5c98af.avif?t=1764333420\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Food</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own food, cook meals, some may even give you a bonus, some might not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Robots are mean.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots like to work to a schedule, keep an eye on the clock, attacks wont stop and they wont get easier either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras/98939e9ca5e39ca1d029b3fc6cd742aa.avif?t=1764333420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras_big/98939e9ca5e39ca1d029b3fc6cd742aa.avif?t=1764333420 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple systems around the ship that need repairing, some workstations require power, try and keep the lights on and see what happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shuttle Pod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POI's and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-Gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats and ailments</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this is currently single player, the game will support up to 4 Coop soon, just some more testing to be done. Be aware, the game will scale the more people you have, the Robots don't like company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Saragan Games Limited</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This company was created by Saragan, an indie developer, founded in 2025. This Game was a labor of love built over years in any spare/free time while holding a full time job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saragan is committed to pushing boundaries and to listen to his community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you survive on the Forsaken?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Forsaken, you are a clone on a broken ship. You must repair the ship and escape the nearby asteroid field. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things are not that easy, an alien robotic race wants the ship, and they will do anything to stop you escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine Asteroids</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine the nearby asteroids for resources. Upgrade your mining ship to travel faster, increase how far you can go and get more valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be vigilant, the robotic aliens lurk in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras/4e8dd3c00d71e75c9fb61fe442029168.avif?t=1764333420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras_big/4e8dd3c00d71e75c9fb61fe442029168.avif?t=1764333420 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new weapons and craft items to repair the ship, there are many workstations to unlock so you better get leveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras/d9eb7d42a1bbaf1dd49b060fab5c98af.avif?t=1764333420\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Food</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own food, cook meals, some may even give you a bonus, some might not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Robots are mean.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots like to work to a schedule, keep an eye on the clock, attacks wont stop and they wont get easier either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras/98939e9ca5e39ca1d029b3fc6cd742aa.avif?t=1764333420\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646930/extras_big/98939e9ca5e39ca1d029b3fc6cd742aa.avif?t=1764333420 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple systems around the ship that need repairing, some workstations require power, try and keep the lights on and see what happens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shuttle Pod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POI's and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-Gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key bindings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats and ailments</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this is currently single player, the game will support up to 4 Coop soon, just some more testing to be done. Be aware, the game will scale the more people you have, the Robots don't like company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Saragan Games Limited</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This company was created by Saragan, an indie developer, founded in 2025. This Game was a labor of love built over years in any spare/free time while holding a full time job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saragan is committed to pushing boundaries and to listen to his community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
